92e786b3960f3.mp4?t=1754027946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cast features The Sphere Hunter, Akidearest, Elsie Lovelock, Sharla in Japan, Knite, Kin Ryan, and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/extras/46c442117d5577a5cddbc49bd098635c.poster.avif?t=1754027946\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/extras/46c442117d5577a5cddbc49bd098635c.webm?t=1754027946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/extras/46c442117d5577a5cddbc49bd098635c.mp4?t=1754027946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u27a4 Multiple endings will be influenced by the various choices made throughout the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u27a4 Distinctive, eerie creatures will each symbolize a different trauma experienced by Anne. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u27a4 Emphasis will be placed on Anne's smartphone, which will feature numerous functions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/extras/da8b2578e665b7a60c8025b59a6fc56f.poster.avif?t=1754027946\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/extras/da8b2578e665b7a60c8025b59a6fc56f.webm?t=1754027946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133830/extras/da8b2578e665b7a60c8025b59a6fc56f.mp4?t=1754027946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>  </p>",
